{"name":"c3_60","cols":60,"rows":40,"claude":"2.1.301","model":"haiku","truth":["```python\nimport os\nx = 1\n\ndef f():\n    return \"lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua ut enim ad minim veniam\"\nprint(f())\n```\n\n파이썬 블록 다음은 자바스크립트입니다.\n\n```javascript\nconst nums = [1, 2, 3];\nconst doubled = nums.map((n) => n * 2);\nconst total = doubled.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0);\nconsole.log(doubled, total);\nexport default total;\n```\n\n자바스크립트 다음은 셸 명령입니다.\n\n```bash\n#!/bin/bash\nls -la ~/Downloads | head -n 5\necho \"done\"\n```\n\n셸 다음은 JSON입니다.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"demo\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"scripts\": {\"start\": \"node index.js\"},\n  \"license\": \"MIT\"\n}\n```\n\nJSON 다음은 HTML입니다.\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<title>Demo</title>\n<h1>Hello</h1>\n<p>World</p>\n```\n\nHTML 다음은 mermaid 흐름도입니다.\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  A[Start] --> B{Ok?}\n  B -->|yes| C[Done]\n  B -->|no| A\n```\n\n마지막은 언어 태그가 없는 평문입니다.\n\n```\n첫 번째 줄입니다.\n두 번째 줄입니다.\n세 번째 줄입니다.\n```"],"ev":[[0,"GzcbW3IbOBtbPzI1aA=="],[0.251,"G1s/MjVs"],[0.251,"G1s/MjAwNGgbWz8yMDMxaBtbPzEwMDRo"],[0.356,"G1s+MHEbWz91"],[0.356,"G103NTAxOz8H"],[0.356,"G1tj"],[0.854,"G1s+NG0bWzx1G1s/MTAwNGwbWz8yMDMxbBtbPzIwMDRs"],[1.181,"G1s/MjAwNGgbWz8yMDMxaBtbPzEwMDRo"],[1.377,"G10wO+KcsyBDbGF1ZGUgQ29kZQc="],[1.438,""],[1.809,"Ry9lZmZvcnQbWzM5bQ0NChtbMkMbWzRBG1s/MjVo"],[3.808,"G1s/MjVsG1syRBtbNEING1s1MkMbWzJBG1szODsyOzE1MzsxNTM7MTUzbTcgYWdlG1szOW0NDQoNChtbMkMbWzRBG1s/MjVo"],[3.998,"G1s+MHE="],[3.998,"G1s/dQ=="],[3.998,"G103NTAxOz8H"],[3.998,"G1tj"],[6.081,"GyhCDxtbPzIwMDRo"],[6.647,""],[7.226,"G1s0MkdjeWNsZSkbWzM5bQ0NChtbNDFHG1szODsyOzE1MzsxNTM7MTUzbeKXkBtbNDNHbWVkaXVtG1s1MEfCtxtbNTJHL2VmZm9ydBtbMzltDQ0KG1syMEMbWzRBG1s/MjVo"],[7.64,"G10wO+KXkCBDbGF1ZGUgQ29kZQc="],[7.911,""],[7.931,""],[7.944,"G1s/MjVsG1syRBtbNEING1s4QRtbMzg7MjsyMTU7MTE5Ozg3bcK3G1szOW0NDQoNCg0KDQoNCg0KDQoNChtbMkMbWzRBG1s/MjVo"],[9.727,""]